<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"Noto Sans SC","Source Han Sans SC","PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 120, padding: '34px 64px 0', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A', lineHeight: 1.3 }}>L0 · 缓存与版本治理：改一行知识，缓存自动失效</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 8 }}>缓存难点从来不是「存」，是「何时失效」</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 540, padding: '20px 64px 0', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 700, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 14, padding: '20px 24px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7DD3FC', letterSpacing: 3, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>缓存键结构 · CACHE KEY</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 4, marginTop: 16, flexWrap: 'wrap' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#38BDF8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>mfg:kbqa:v2:</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#F97316', fontWeight: 'bold', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>{'{faq_version}'}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>:</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#60A5FA', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>{'{sha1(query|top_k)}'}</Text>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 26, marginTop: 18 }}>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, borderRadius: 5, background: '#38BDF8' }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#CBD5E1' }}>固定命名空间</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, borderRadius: 5, background: '#F97316' }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#CBD5E1' }}>版本戳：知识一改就换</Text>
                    </Box>
                    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8 }}>
                        <Box style={{ width: 10, height: 10, borderRadius: 5, background: '#60A5FA' }} />
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#CBD5E1' }}>同题同参才命中</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#EFF6FF', border: '1px solid #BFDBFE', borderRadius: 12, padding: '14px 18px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#2563EB', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>版本戳构成 · FAQ_VERSION</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0F172A', marginTop: 8, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>policy:{'{count}'}:{'{max_id}'} | faq:{'{count}'}:{'{max_id}'}</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.55, marginTop: 8 }}>制度主数据与晋升 FAQ 的「条数 + 最大 ID」拼成版本戳。任何写操作都会改变它——缓存键随之换命名空间，旧键自然不可达，不需要主动失效，也没有竞态。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '13px 18px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <FAIcon name='bolt' style={{ fill: '#F97316', width: 26, height: 26 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, flex: 1 }}>缓存只包 L2 / direct 两条贵路径；L1 命中（7ms）和路由（sub-ms）根本不值得缓存。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#0F172A', borderRadius: 12, padding: '13px 20px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14 }}>
                <Box style={{ width: 5, height: 32, borderRadius: 3, background: '#F97316' }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#F8FAFC', lineHeight: 1.45, flex: 1 }}>19ms 回放不是优化技巧，是版本治理的副产品</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#FFF7ED', border: '1px solid #FED7AA', borderRadius: 14, padding: '16px 20px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#B45309', letterSpacing: 2, fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>缓存回放 · CACHE REPLAY</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16, marginTop: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 64, fontWeight: 'bold', lineHeight: 1, backgroundImage: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #F97316 0%, #FBBF24 100%)', backgroundClip: 'text', color: 'transparent', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>19ms</Text>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#9A3412', lineHeight: 1.4 }}>对比：域内 RAG<br />全程 2722ms</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 12, color: '#B45309', marginTop: 4 }}>回放约为其 1/143</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', border: '1px solid #E2E8F0', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 16px', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 22, height: 22, borderRadius: 6, background: '#2563EB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 2 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>1</Text></Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>版本戳即失效</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 3 }}>写操作换命名空间，旧键自然不可达——无定时清理、无竞态。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 22, height: 22, borderRadius: 6, background: '#2563EB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 2 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>2</Text></Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>坏了不缓存</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 3 }}>rag_unavailable / degraded 状态主动删除、绝不入缓存——不把坏答案存起来。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-start', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Box style={{ width: 22, height: 22, borderRadius: 6, background: '#2563EB', justifyContent: 'center', alignItems: 'center', marginTop: 2 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 11, color: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>3</Text></Box>
                    <Box style={{ flex: 1 }}>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0F172A' }}>Redis 故障静默降级</Text>
                        <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#475569', lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 3 }}>连不上就无缓存运行 + 30s 冷却，绝不因为缓存挂掉而答不了问题。</Text>
                    </Box>
                </Box>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ background: '#ECFEFF', border: '1px solid #A5F3FC', borderRadius: 12, padding: '12px 18px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#0E7490', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>TTL</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E7490', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>1800s</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#155E75', flex: 1 }}>双保险：版本戳管「内容变」，TTL 管「没人问」</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: '0 64px', position: 'relative' }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 10 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 12, height: 12, borderRadius: 3, background: '#2563EB' }} />
            <Box style={{ width: 9, height: 9, borderRadius: 5, background: '#06B6D4' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>mfg-agent-platform · 独立开发实践分享</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', fontFamily: '"JetBrains Mono","Space Grotesk",Consolas,monospace' }}>13 / 20</Text>
        <Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 0, left: 0, width: 1280, height: 3, background: 'linear-gradient(90deg, #2563EB 0%, #06B6D4 55%, rgba(6,182,212,0) 100%)' }} />
    </Box>
</Slide>
